# ChangeLog file for MonetDB
# This file is updated with Maddlog

* Thu Oct 22 2026 Martin van Dinther <martin.van.dinther@monetdbsolutions.com>
- Added support for reading DNA sequence alignment data from *.sam and *.bam files.
  Usage examples:
    SELECT * FROM '/path/to/file1.bam';
  or
    SELECT * FROM file_loader('/path/to/file1.bam');
  Prerequisites:
  We use the HTSlib for reading these files and the library needs to be
  pre-installed on your OS (e.g. on Fedora via: sudo dnf install htslib).
  See also: https://www.htslib.org/download/
  Also the MonetDB server has to be started with startup argument:
   --loadmodule htslib
  to enable it. By default it is not enabled.

